/S /P
/E (The multi-agent reinforcement learning framework was deployed to trade six SGX stocks over 2,500 days, utilizing seven optimized agents. This approach achieved a 196.31% ROI. During a high-volatility period from 2019 to 2023, with IFDTNN forecasted result, it achieved a 71.1% ROI. By dynamically selecting the best-performing agent for each stock, the framework demonstrated that no single model dominates universally.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
